caption: Vampire Field Manual — 📋 Post-Encounter Reporting
campaign-component: post-encounter-reporting

All encounters with vampiric entities must be logged in Triplicate with the following attachments:

Photographic evidence (pre- and post-combat, if applicable).

Any recovered dust, ashes, or enchanted artifacts (bagged separately).

Medical clearance form (bite wounds require blood test within 24 hours).

Public relations statement draft (“Our brave contractors faced challenges with professionalism and compassion”).

Failure to file paperwork within 48 hours constitutes breach of contract and forfeiture of hazard pay.
